// The checkout — turns a cart into a Stripe Checkout Session, server-side,
// priced from the catalog (the browser's prices are never trusted). One
// secret (STRIPE_SECRET_KEY) wires the whole store: no hand-made payment
// links, no per-SKU setup [D2]. Without the secret it returns 503 and the
// cart falls back to the shop desk, so the store works either way [D12].
//
// POST { items: [{ sku, tier, qty }] } -> { url }  (redirect the customer)
//
// The PRICES block below is generated by tools/build_site.py from
// data/catalog/catalog.json — do not hand-edit it; rebuild.

/* GEN:PRICES */
